--- Binds a key with exact modifiers ("f9", "ctrl+1", or "^!f1": ^ Ctrl, ! Alt, ~ Shift) to a line run as typed or a function. The key is taken from the game. A line other than a //mod command is a game action (needs actions). Options: up (fire on release), typing (fire while a text field is open too).
